[32m+[m[32m-- =====================================================================[m
[32m+[m[32m-- 8. QUALITY CONTROL[m
[32m+[m[32m--[m
[32m+[m[32m-- One inspection header can inspect multiple batches from one source document.[m
[32m+[m[32m-- Suggested inspection status: DRAFT / IN_PROGRESS / COMPLETED / CANCELLED[m
[32m+[m[32m-- Suggested line result: PASS / FAIL / PARTIAL[m
